   └─ e.g. --maxWorkers 100%
"
`;

exports[`test.acceptance.credfree given: [case3] a live run of one fast acceptance file when: [t0] no width is asked then: it exits 0, echoes only the scope, and prints the run header, the totals, and the log 1`] = `
"🧮 test.acceptance.credfree --scope 'acceptance\\.shares-the-box'
   ├─ result = green, exit 0
   │
   ├─ notes
   │  ├─
   │  │
   │  │  ℹ acceptance width
   │  │     ├─ box = shared (no GITHUB_ACTIONS host signal; CI=true alone does not widen)
   │  │     ├─ workers = <N> of <N> cores (shared-box default)
   │  │     ├─ priority = nice <N>
   │  │     └─ to go wide, pass --maxWorkers 100%
   │  └─
   │
   ├─ totals
   │  ├─ Test Suites: 1 passed, 1 total
   │  ├─ Tests:       3 passed, 3 total
   │  └─ Snapshots:   0 total
   │
   └─ log
      └─ .log/role=any/skill=test.acceptance.credfree/<STAMP>.log
"
`;

