exports[`test.acceptance.credfree given: [case5] a red run, its log written by a stub pnpm when: [t0] the run leaked a process, so it is red with no failed test then: it exits 1, reads red above the green totals, and carries the leak report onto stdout 1`] = `
"🧮 test.acceptance.credfree --scope 'demo'
   ├─ result = red, exit 1
   │
   ├─ notes
   │  ├─
   │  │
   │  │  ℹ acceptance width
   │  │     ├─ box = shared (no GITHUB_ACTIONS host signal; CI=true alone does not widen)
   │  │     ├─ workers = <N> of <N> cores (shared-box default)
   │  │     ├─ priority = nice <N>
   │  │     └─ to go wide, pass --maxWorkers 100%
   │  │
   │  │  ✋ ConstraintError: 1 process outlived this acceptance run
   │  │     ├─ it carries this run id (r7f3a91c2), so a test of this run spawned it and did not end it
   │  │     ├─ leaked
   │  │     │  └─ pid 4242 = node /repo/src/.test/assets/stubBrainCli.cjs
   │  │     │     └─ cwd = /tmp/test-fns/rhachet/.temp/r7f3a91c2.demo.a1b2c3d4
   │  │     │
   │  │     ├─ this run ended it, so the box is clean
   │  │     └─ to fix, the test that spawned it must own its child
   │  │        ├─ spawn it via spawnRhachetCliBackground, which ends its process group
   │  │        └─ or end it in that test's own afterAll
   │  └─
   │
   ├─ totals
   │  ├─ Test Suites: 1 passed, 1 total
   │  └─ Tests:       3 passed, 3 total
   │
   └─ log
      └─ .log/role=any/skill=test.acceptance.credfree/<STAMP>.log
"
`;

